00:11:31.180 --> 00:11:34.760
The battle to determine the Momodo King.

00:11:35.600 --> 00:11:39.380
A hundred Momodo fighting each other, trying to burn each other's books.

00:11:41.050 --> 00:11:45.160
And the one that survives until the very end becomes the king of the Momodo world.

00:11:46.800 --> 00:11:48.560
In other words, we're enemies.

00:11:50.110 --> 00:11:51.970
Shouldn't you be a bit more cautious?

00:11:52.640 --> 00:11:52.880
Yeah.

00:11:53.660 --> 00:11:53.860
Huh?

00:11:55.100 --> 00:11:58.220
I noticed your spell book too, but I didn't say anything.

00:11:58.840 --> 00:11:59.980
Figured it was fine for now because...

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:02.040
because Ted and Zat seem to be getting along so well.

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:06.590
So I see. Been in many battles?

00:12:07.180 --> 00:12:10.890
Huh? Yeah, probably more than other Momodo.

00:12:11.790 --> 00:12:13.090
But we don't like fighting.

00:12:14.150 --> 00:12:16.730
You don't seem like a bad person, but you do seem strong.

00:12:17.090 --> 00:12:18.650
I'm sure you'll give me plenty to worry about.

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:21.260
What should I make of this guy?

00:12:21.690 --> 00:12:24.950
He's young, but it sounds like he's been through a considerable number of battles.

00:12:28.380 --> 00:12:29.980
Sounds good to me! I'm...

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:36.720
satisfied looks like you've been through the ringer kid big time i also won't fight today

00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:42.250
it's the least i can do after you fed us and put us up for the night besides we're in agreement

00:12:42.250 --> 00:12:47.440
ted and i also don't like fighting he has no interest in becoming king ted has a different

00:12:47.440 --> 00:12:54.030
goal in mind what kind of different goal his only family ted's been looking for a long time

00:12:54.030 --> 00:12:59.640
his goal is finding his family yeah

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:05.000
Yeah, sometimes he can be a stupid and cocky kid, but he knows about the important things in life.

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:08.550
I suppose. Just maybe. That's why I go along with him.

00:13:09.340 --> 00:13:10.650
Maybe you're friends.

00:13:39.630 --> 00:13:41.710
You two are formidable after all.

00:13:43.410 --> 00:13:49.130
You two have awakened, just as I directed you.

00:13:50.120 --> 00:13:52.490
My name is Arth.

00:13:53.090 --> 00:13:54.930
Proceed to an area where we can fight.

00:13:56.510 --> 00:13:59.930
Also, there seems to be two other memo-

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:06.930
in your dwelling what I need only concerns you two if you ask either of

00:14:06.930 --> 00:14:12.460
those other two Momodo for help then I will be forced to make your home our

00:14:12.460 --> 00:14:26.140
battleground I see wait right there we're coming down nice strong so but we can't

00:14:26.140 --> 00:14:28.900
fight here in the house where mom is sleeping come on

00:14:30.920 --> 00:14:32.520
Time to get into battle mode, Satch.

00:14:34.580 --> 00:14:51.680
Let us begin!

00:14:54.540 --> 00:14:57.110
Wait! Hold it! At least tell us something first!

00:14:57.630 --> 00:14:59.930
