00:15:43.980 --> 00:15:47.020
I thought my sword without a spell was enough for you, Ellie!

00:16:17.790 --> 00:16:19.090
Are you talking about Bao's Akerga?

00:16:21.980 --> 00:16:23.760
Correct! That's the Bao!

00:16:24.020 --> 00:16:26.900
Fine! Then why are you targeting us just because we use Bao?

00:16:36.270 --> 00:16:39.280
Think that bow is just a regular spell?

00:16:40.150 --> 00:16:41.410
What do you mean?

00:16:48.990 --> 00:16:50.470
You haven't realized it.

00:16:52.180 --> 00:16:53.360
Several months earlier,

00:16:56.560 --> 00:16:59.540
Menace of the Momodo world appeared in the human world.

00:17:00.480 --> 00:17:02.880
I cannot let the menace run loose here.

00:17:04.500 --> 00:17:07.390
