00:17:22.300 --> 00:17:24.880
Right now, you're an opponent that I can handle.

00:17:27.650 --> 00:17:29.910
Means this match will soon be over.

00:17:58.990 --> 00:17:59.970
One blow to wipe out.

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:08.520
Zash even with Rao Zerouk this is over I will put an end to this battle now

00:18:10.020 --> 00:18:19.880
are you going to protect your master to the end then I will finish this match

00:18:19.880 --> 00:18:23.780
with one final strike one worthy of your courage

00:18:36.330 --> 00:18:37.210
It's huge!

00:19:00.630 --> 00:19:02.510
