00:21:07.410 --> 00:21:07.770
Ted!

00:21:08.850 --> 00:21:10.690
Zatch, I can't see his sword!

00:21:12.140 --> 00:21:14.060
Keo, we have to save my friend!

00:21:14.620 --> 00:21:18.340
Don't miss as the battle continues on the next Zatch Bell!
